//
// WHAT IT NO LONGER ASKS (owner decision, 2026-07-27). It used to carry the atoms each outcome
// awards and test the objective's completion predicate at every terminal, because completion was
// INFERRED from an accumulated bag of flags. Objectives now resolve because a scene resolved -
// the Adventurers League model, where finishing Part 1 advances you whether it went well or
